2 PDT) at LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1. Evidence: tests/unit/test_install_extras_parity.py failed 3 of 4 on the old Makefile, passes on the new one, and fails again when an extra is dropped from TEST_EXTRAS. After make install in this worktree, import fastapi/jinja2/hcl2 succeeds. make verify in this freshly provisioned worktree: 20034 passed, 0 failed, 28 skipped (was 88), none skipped for a missing reviewbot/ui/grounding-terraform package (checked with -rs). docs/local-dev-env.md no longer says make install deliberately skips those tests.","timestamp":1793330056829153001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1793307526363983001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fea8a9b9-4da0-4925-b0a2-4d4bbf5594ab","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"06c1-f789-e9ba-479b"},{"link_uuid":"a3ce2cc4-e5be-44a7-81d4-ba952afdc9d6","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"1628-570d-7c26-4a7d"}],"description":"## Observation\n\nAGENTS.md says `make test` \"selects exactly what CI's gating `ubuntu-latest, py3.13` cell selects\". The selection markers match, but the installed packages do not:\n- CI's gating pytest job installs `uv sync --locked --extra dev --extra reviewbot --extra ui --extra grounding-terraform` (.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml, line 495).\n- `make install` runs `uv sync --locked --extra dev --extra metrics` (Makefile, line 101).\n\nTests guarded by `pytest.importorskip(\"fastapi\")` and similar are therefore skipped locally and only run in CI. On 2026-10-29, `make verify` passed on Gerrit 3141 (19,819 passed, 88 skipped) while CI failed `tests/unit/test_review_bot.py::test_lifespan_drains_queued_events_on_shutdown`, which `make verify` had skipped because the worktree venv had no fastapi.\n\nvampiric-dollfaced-aurochs fixed the CI side of this (no lane installed the reviewbot extra); the local install was not aligned.\n\n## Plan\n1. In the Makefile, name the extras once (a `TEST_EXTRAS` variable holding `reviewbot ui grounding-terraform`) and have `install` sync `dev metrics` plus those, and `install-unlocked` install the same set. `make worktree` provisions through `make install`, so it follows.\n2. Add `tests/unit/test_install_extras_parity.py`. It reads the extras named by `--extra` on the gating pytest job's `uv sync` line in `.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml`, removes `dev` (which `install` names separately), and asserts the result equals the Makefile's `TEST_EXTRAS` as a set. A second assertion checks that the `install` recipe's `uv sync` line and `install-unlocked`'s pip line both expand `TEST_EXTRAS`. `metrics` stays an install-only extra and is not part of the comparison.\n3. Rewrite the `docs/local-dev-env.md` section \"Running the tests CI runs\": it currently says `make install` deliberately stays lean and skips ~38 tests, which contradicts AGENTS.md's statement that `make verify` is the locally checkable half of Verified.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [x] `tests/unit/test_install_extras_parity.py` passes, and fails when an extra is added to or removed from either the gating cell's `uv sync` line (excluding `dev`) or `TEST_EXTRAS`.\n- [x] The parity test fails when `install` stops expanding `TEST_EXTRAS`.\n- [x] After `make install`, `python -c \"import fastapi\"` succeeds in the venv.\n- [x] `make verify` in a freshly provisioned worktree reports fewer skips than 88, and none from a missing reviewbot, ui or grounding-terraform package.\n\n## File impact (expected)\n- Makefile\n- tests/unit/ (new parity test)\n- docs/local-dev-env.md","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"Makefile","reason":"TEST_EXTRAS variable; install and install-unlocked sync it"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_install_extras_parity.py","reason":"new parity test against the gating CI cell"},{"path":"docs/local-dev-env.md","reason":"rewrite the lean-install paragraph"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","1628-570d-7c26-4a7d"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"0e1fec29-1e30-44af-b96f-2b1ca563c6a8","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9b28-415d-0780-4b2a","ticket_type":"bug","title":"make verify skips tests that CI's gating cell runs: make install omits the reviewbot, ui and grounding-terraform extras","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["d228bdde-38b5-4ab7-9003-cfe98d091254","fbb03b12-c06b-459a-a7d1-07807ba2753a","9d6eadb3-24ee-4303-84a8-82ad10d92c2a","8fa96e21-4793-4535-8a67-a75b01e40f76","f021aa0f-aa3a-4fd1-b0be-b8705f8f3dff","4da99d56-bef7-4104-a776-a3f2e4f5522f","a3ce2cc4-e5be-44a7-81d4-ba952afdc9d6","37310c9b-bc65-49c9-82aa-fb8a040c6aa6","6c0ad9ac-0939-4b52-902b-b7a8aa63c52d","0e1fec29-1e30-44af-b96f-2b1ca563c6a8","274b8554-e2bb-4153-855f-ac15b28a0bd5"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793340957191590591,"uuid":"e18aca1e-2360-4a35-adac-0b809422873f"}